+Text segmentation affects the units, relations, and statistical trials on
+which sentence-level watermark guarantees depend. Our SWAN audit establishes
+a reversible short-text decision change, sufficiently explained by the
+existing statistic's unit-count ceiling. Exact evaluation supplies a
+conditional positive guarantee for all partitions in a declared fixed-token,
+fixed-count neighborhood, and independent oracles verify the implementation.
