+resource gates, so no real certified rate follows. The study is an
+evaluation framework and influence-factor audit: it identifies observed
+interface dependence, conditions for a bounded guarantee, and evidence still
+needed to establish a practical effective region. Strong rewriting can
+invalidate the declared coverage; it is not thereby proved to defeat every
+sentence-dependent watermark.
 
